    "message": "feat(admin): rename page to \"Configure Claude Code\" + surface per-session alternative\n\nThe v5.7.0 Claude Code page read as the only way to connect the CLI. Rename\nthe nav label, page title, and heading to \"Configure Claude Code\" to make it\nclear it configures the persistent settings file. The page (and README) now\nalso mention the per-session alternative: run `mcc-claude` to point only the\ncurrent shell at My Claude Code without touching any file, or\n`mcc-claude --discover-models` to also list gateway models — leaving normal\n`claude` on your standard Anthropic account.\n\nOnboarding step instruction updated to match the new page name. Verified in a\nreal browser: nav shows \"Configure Claude Code\", the page renders the\nConfigure button and the mcc-claude note. Full suite: 3706 passed, 26 known\nenvironmental failures, zero new regressions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
